WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 013. THE MODEL IS ONE STAGE. The workflow produces consequence.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
HANDOFFS. INTAKE → DATA → MODEL → ACTION. Add decisions and monitoring.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
RISK. WHERE DOES IT ENTER? Different failures begin at different stages.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
PATH. WHAT CAN IT REACH? Downstream work inherits missing controls.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
CONTROL. OWNER. STOP. MONITOR. Every handoff needs accountable power.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. FOLLOW THE CONSEQUENCE. Scores expose gaps; they never approve.
